# A Killer Among Us: "Sacrifice this enchantment, Reveal the creature type you chose: If target attacking creature token is the
# chosen type, put three +1/+1 counters on it and it gains deathtouch until end of turn." Bot1 chose Goblin in secret on turn 1
# (the tokens are three 1/1s). On turn 3 the Goblin token attacks; paying the cost sacrifices the enchantment and reveals Goblin,
# which is public on the ability on the stack (CR 608.2b: the type is the one revealed, the enchantment is gone). The Goblin is
# 4/4 with deathtouch, hits for 4 (Bot2 at 16) and the other tokens are untouched. At turn 5 the deathtouch is gone, the counters stay.

